  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Offgrid Solar Home Systems in Disaster-vulnerable Low-income Communities in Surigao Islands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Active</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is designed to provide immediate energy service to 1,000 households in disaster vulnerable and off-grid island community of Surigao, via providing a set of Cloudgrid unit, composed of solar panel, energy storage box, LED bulbs, USB ports for mobile charging. The project is consisted of two major outputs: 1) Solar Cloudgrid units deployed to underprivileged 1,000 off-the-grid community households; 2) Technical training sessions provided to the targeted off-grid community households and relevant LGUs in 4 targeted island barangays</narrative>
  </description>
